<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche certificates soar on merger rumours.</title>
<headline>Roche certificates soar on merger rumours.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roche Holding AG certificates soared 11.7 percent on unconfirmed market rumours Roche would merge with a foreign company or spin off a business, dealers said.</p>
<p>Non-voting participation certificates were up 1,305 Swiss francs to 12,475 around midday in busy trading.</p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
